Qwen3.8 Flash Next vLLM image for NVIDIA DGX Spark / ASUS Ascent GX10

This image is derived from vLLM commit
f561eca6ca4f3f79808a696b1521cb76dc8aafa2 and contains local modifications
for Qwen3.8 Flash Next SSD-backed PLE execution and GB10 decode tuning.

This software contains source code provided by NVIDIA Corporation.

